# API Documentation

This guide shows how to use the `Widget` API.

## Installation

Run the installer:

```bash
npm install @acme/widget
```

## TypeScript usage

Import the client and call `createWidget`:

```typescript
export function createWidget(name: string): Widget {
  return new Widget(name);
}

export class Widget {
  constructor(private name: string) {}

  render(): string {
    return `<widget name="${this.name}" />`;
  }
}
```

## Python usage

The Python bindings mirror the TypeScript API:

```python
def create_widget(name):
    return Widget(name)


class Widget:
    def __init__(self, name):
        self.name = name

    def render(self):
        return f'<widget name="{self.name}" />'
```

